Stage 1’s mounted records are internally consistent so far: the campaign lock deep-matches its manifest block, all declared pipeline-v3 record hashes match, the trusted semantics mount is present, and recursive comparison found no candidate-side semantics differences or symlinks. I’m now preserving those checks and separating fresh source-only reconstruction from candidate caches.
