+
+Result: `#Top`, exit 0.
+
+Exact bounded logs:
+
+- `evidence/stage3-kompile-haskell.log`;
+- `evidence/stage3-kprove-loop.log`; and
+- `evidence/stage3-kprove-all.log`.
+
+Stage 3 result: **PASS**. Every positive target claim closes in a fresh
