+- `evidence/run_integrity_checks.sh`;
+- `evidence/stage1-integrity.log`; and
+- `evidence/stage1-reviewer-tree-hashes.log`.
+
+### Candidate/trusted comparisons and artifact types
+
+`cmp` establishes byte identity for:
